<v SPEAKER_1>Yeah. I think something that comes across with Brandon and just it's very factual, whether you like him or not, he doesn't have to do this. He has put his own money into this. This is not a money making scheme because I think anyone who's in the UFO community, there are very few people who make money from it. This is a guy who's got enough money. As you see enough other projects that this is definitely a labor of love for him as well. Then something I think obviously Brandon's came into most of our lives through the show like yourself. Until you appear on the show and we get to know you, that's when you start existing for most people. Was that meeting with Brandon, am I right in saying around 2017?

