01:45:07.748 --> 01:45:30.768
<v SPEAKER_2>Yeah, I'm starting to think it would have to be extraterrestrial. I've always been of the mindset that it was just secret projects with governments, deep state type stuff. But I'm coming more of the mindset that some of these possibly, probably are extraterrestrial.

01:45:32.168 --> 01:45:54.128
