01:47:43.048 --> 01:48:06.228
<v SPEAKER_2>I think that cognitive and consciousness is probably the main thing we should be focusing on the ranch. I think it plays huge into it. Matter of fact, you asked me, I think it makes up my personal opinion, is that's what we should be spending our time looking at. But yeah, absolutely huge.

01:48:07.628 --> 01:48:09.288
<v SPEAKER_1>Two more. Robert Bigelow.

01:48:13.688 --> 01:48:19.088
<v SPEAKER_2>This is public or private? He is mysterious.

01:48:20.548 --> 01:48:31.968
<v SPEAKER_1>He certainly is. The last one, I like to end all of my guests with the same one, is disclosure and what is Skinwalker Ranch? What is Skinwalker Ranch's part in disclosure?

01:48:34.628 --> 01:50:20.048
<v SPEAKER_2>Yeah, disclosure is very important. I'm grateful to work on a team. We all have the same common goal, and that is disclosure. And I know that all the gentlemen that I work with, our credibility means everything to us. We're not here. Personally, I don't care about the fame. I'm definitely not getting rich off of this. At least I haven't seen any of it yet. This is about getting answers. And there are enough smart people in the world that if we try to sell a bunch of lies, history is going to show us to be a bunch of fools. And that's not what we want. We want to play a part in this. And I think that Skinwalker Ranch has the possibility and a real probability of playing a huge part, being very instrumental in helping us understand the world around us even better than we do now and helping us gain answers to the, as of right now, the unexplained and some of these unseen forces that we coexist with in this world, whether it be other realms or, you know, just physics that we don't understand yet. And I think Skinwalker Ranch, if we're allowed to continue this investigation, and the investigation is going to happen whether the cameras roll or not. Brandon's committed to this. It's been happening for 3 years before the cameras came. It will continue after the cameras go. And, but I believe the ranch has the potential to be one of the greatest assets in this space for obtaining the answers that everybody's seeking.

01:50:20.428 --> 01:50:28.268
<v SPEAKER_1>So Thomas, it's been great speaking with you. And just before you go, have you got any final words for the listeners, where they can follow you, where they can find you?

01:50:29.648 --> 01:51:22.128
<v SPEAKER_2>Yeah, so I appreciate all the listeners. Thank you for watching. Thank you for listening to the podcast. Thank you for being engaged. I love all of our viewers, whether they like us or hate us. I just appreciate the fact that they're spending time with us, and that they're engaged in this subject. And they can... I am online. You know, I'm trying to change. I've been a very private person in the past, so social media has not been my big thing. I'm working on that. So I'm on Facebook, and I'm on Twitter, and I'm on Instagram. So they can search me out, Thomas Winterton. I think Thomas R. Winterton. I don't remember some of those.

01:51:23.788 --> 01:51:25.288
<v SPEAKER_1>I'll put the links in the bio.

01:51:25.668 --> 01:51:55.868
<v SPEAKER_2>Okay. Yeah. They can check me out online, and I encourage them to go check out what my wife's doing with meditation. It's interesting. It goes hand in hand with what we're seeing at the ranch. Some of this quantum cognitive things, very much into inner energy, and the results that we're seeing with this meditation is massive. People are getting into a theta state of meditation with her process in 45 to 60 seconds, which is phenomenal. So anyways, encourage people to check that out as well.

01:51:56.728 --> 01:52:03.568
